It is Huly's compiled platform model — a JSON array of TxCreateDoc/TxMixin
transactions defining Huly's class graph, mixins and plugin namespace. It is
the same artifact Huly's own transactor loads as models/all/bundle/model.json.
Its identifier namespace is Huly's: core:class:Doc, tracker:class:Issue,
contact:class:Person, recruit:class:Vacancy, and the activity:, hr:, lead: and
board: plugin classes.

Commit dab16f69 renamed Huly-branded display strings inside this bundle. That
scrub changed strings, not authorship or provenance; the file is Huly's work
and is offered here under Huly's licence.

No other file in this repository is derived from Huly Platform.

Hanzo's own Go code in pkg/transactor/ implements Huly's wire protocol and
therefore names Huly's identifiers as protocol constants (for example
"core:class:Doc" in hierarchy.go, seed.go and txapply.go). Using an interface's
names to interoperate with it is not a derivative of the model bundle; those
files are Hanzo's own work under MIT OR Apache-2.0.

